    "title": "MICROSERVICE_PROD_Dispute Acceptance API",
    "description": "The Dispute Acceptance API allows organizations to confirm the acceptance of disputes, ensuring resolution processes can proceed smoothly. By sending a request with the specific dispute ID, users can formally acknowledge a dispute within the system. This API is typically utilized by customer service representatives and operations teams who manage dispute records. It plays a crucial role in streamlining dispute handling and enhancing customer relations.",
